  "description": "Step into the world of used car trading where every deal can turn into big profit — or a costly mistake. Buy cheap vehicles from owners, negotiate for the best prices, restore damaged cars, and resell them to grow your business from a small garage into a successful reseller empire.\n\nExplore different parts of the city in search of valuable deals, hidden bargains, and rare vehicles. From private sellers to competitive auctions, every opportunity depends on your negotiation skills, smart investments, and ability to spot profitable cars before anyone else.\n\nAs your business expands, you’ll restore more valuable vehicles, improve your workshop, and build a reputation as one of the city’s top car resellers. Every car has potential — if you can turn it into profit.\n\nKey Features:\n• Car Restoration: Clean, polish, and repair used vehicles to increase their market value before selling.\n• Owner Negotiations: Bargain with car owners and lower prices to maximize your profit on every deal.\n• Competitive Car Auctions: Join exciting auctions, outbid rivals, and win valuable or rare vehicles.\n• Business Progression: Start small, grow your reputation, expand your workshop, and build a successful reseller career.\n• Vehicle Variety: Buy and trade different types of used cars with unique conditions and values.\n\nTurn cheap used cars into valuable profits and build your career as the city’s top car reseller. Every deal is a new opportunity to grow your business and expand your reputation.",
